19:12.400 --> 19:13.240
Zhenglun,

19:13.510 --> 19:14.970
jaga adik awak baik-baik.

19:17.240 --> 19:17.880
Baik.

19:18.550 --> 19:19.940
Kalau awak biarkan
dia tercedera sedikit pun,

19:19.940 --> 19:21.400
