19:26.880 --> 19:28.010
Kami harapkan awak.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.310
Berhati-hati.

20:59.350 --> 21:00.880
Tutup pintu gerbang kota!

21:05.510 --> 21:06.750
Tutup pintu gerbang kota!

21:06.750 --> 21:09.410
Menghalang penyamun
daripada menyusup masuk!

21:29.070 --> 21:29.960
Kejar!

22:19.680 --> 22:20.160
Sini!

22:20.400 --> 22:20.920
Sini!

22:21.030 --> 22:21.640
Cepat!

22:22.070 --> 22:22.550
Cepat!

22:24.590 --> 22:25.030
Kejar!

22:25.550 --> 22:26.150
Berhenti!

22:26.310 --> 22:27.040
Jangan lari!

22:28.400 --> 22:29.110
Berhenti!

22:30.200 --> 22:30.920
Sini!

22:31.640 --> 22:33.100
Terima kasih, abang long.

22:33.400 --> 22:34.480
Adik Qingyuan sanggup ambil risiko

22:34.480 --> 22:36.680
