29:34.310 --> 29:35.110
Tuan Muda Pei!

29:35.590 --> 29:36.480
Tuan Muda Pei!

29:37.350 --> 29:38.440
Tuan Yan berada di sebelah barat kota

29:38.440 --> 29:40.440
