40:39.510 --> 40:40.710
Bunuh!

40:42.400 --> 40:43.590
Bunuh!

40:49.440 --> 40:56.960
Bunuh!

41:47.880 --> 41:48.360
Kakak,

41:48.840 --> 41:50.190
